      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمَّآءُ</span></b>  [fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَغَمٌّ</span>, q. v.: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and also used as a
subst.]: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمٌّ</span>, first sentence: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  and also in
the latter half: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  and see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُمَّى</span>, in two
places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَّهُمْ لَفِى غَمَّآءَ مِنَ الأَمْرِ</span> means [<i>Verily
they are in a state of dubiousness,</i> or <i>confusedness,
in respect of the case,</i> or <i>affair;</i> or] <i>in a dubious,</i>
or <i>confused, case</i> or <i>affair.</i> (TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُمَّةٌ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غِمَّةٌ</span>.]

